projects.description:
Refactoring of the previous Rails platform using Kotlin and Vue.js. 

The previous platform was outdated, required a lot of maintenance effort and had a high cost to add new features.

- Most of the apps' content relies on the information provided by this platform;
- Coordination about the kind of information and the defined formats with the mobile teams is necessary;
- It should deal with the management and classification of partners' content up to how it is displayed and organized in the apps.
